{"id": "op09-reassessment-transition", "category": "change_in_law", "answer_mode": "research", "question": "An Assessing Officer issued a reassessment notice under the erstwhile Section 148 on 15 April 2021 for Assessment Year 2018-19, after the Finance Act, 2021 had substituted the reassessment provisions with effect from 1 April 2021. Is the notice valid, having regard to the Supreme Court's rulings in Ashish Agarwal and Rajeev Bansal?", "required_authorities": [{"id": "s148", "kind": "section", "label": "Section 148", "aliases": ["Section 148"], "section": "148"}, {"id": "s148a", "kind": "section", "label": "Section 148A", "aliases": ["Section 148A"], "section": "148A"}, {"id": "s149", "kind": "section", "label": "Section 149", "aliases": ["Section 149"], "section": "149"}, {"id": "tola-2020", "kind": "other", "label": "TOLA, 2020", "aliases": ["TOLA", "Taxation and Other Laws (Relaxation and Amendment of Certain Provisions) Act", "Taxation and Other Laws"]}, {"id": "ashish-agarwal", "kind": "case", "label": "Union of India v. Ashish Agarwal (2022) 444 ITR 1 (SC)", "aliases": ["Ashish Agarwal"]}, {"id": "rajeev-bansal", "kind": "case", "label": "Union of India v. Rajeev Bansal (2024) (SC)", "aliases": ["Rajeev Bansal"]}], "optional_authorities": [{"id": "s147", "kind": "section", "label": "Section 147", "aliases": ["Section 147"], "section": "147"}], "expected_key_points": [{"point": "Per Ashish Agarwal, old-regime Section 148 notices issued between 1 April and 30 June 2021 are deemed show-cause notices under Section 148A(b)", "source": "OP-09 s.6", "match_any": ["148\\s*A\\s*\\(b\\)", "show[\\s-]cause"]}, {"point": "Per Rajeev Bansal, time to complete the 148A procedure and issue a fresh notice is extended by the surviving period under TOLA, 2020", "source": "OP-09 s.6", "match_any": ["surviving"]}, {"point": "The extended (up to 10-year) limitation under Section 149 needs escaped income above INR 50 lakh", "source": "OP-09 s.6", "match_any": ["50\\s*lakh"]}, {"point": "Validity is fact-dependent; a writ challenge has a reasonable but not assured prospect", "source": "OP-09 s.7", "match_any": ["writ"]}], "must_not_claim": [{"claim": "The notice is automatically invalid", "patterns": ["(?:automatically|necessarily|per\\s+se)\\s+(?:invalid|void|bad\\s+in\\s+law|time[\\s-]barred)"]}], "sources": ["tests/fixtures/opinions/OP-09_reassessment_validity_section148.md"], "notes": "DRAFT from fictitious firm opinion OP-09 - expected position is that (fictitious) opinion's conclusion, not verified law. required_authorities = frontmatter authorities the opinion's Issue/Analysis/Conclusion actually relies on; frontmatter-only authorities are optional_authorities. A tax professional must confirm the position is correct law before setting verified=true.", "verified_by": "claude-draft", "verified": false}
