be)\\s+not\\s+taxable\\s+in\\s+India"]}], "sources": ["tests/fixtures/opinions/OP-13_indirect_transfer_explanation5.md"], "notes": "DRAFT from fictitious firm opinion OP-13 - expected position is that (fictitious) opinion's conclusion, not verified law. required_authorities = frontmatter authorities the opinion's Issue/Analysis/Conclusion actually relies on; frontmatter-only authorities are optional_authorities. A tax professional must confirm the position is correct law before setting verified=true.", "verified_by": "claude-draft", "verified": false}
